#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0554 expect=violation domain=AE
#note "R-5.25 wave-3 group K split of CG0554 (each missing key variable is its own defect): the STUDYID column is not in the dataset. The Check is the absence assertion itself (the M15 shape this very rule modelled), every leaf a dataset-level fact, so Sensitivity derives Dataset and the absence is reported ONCE."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset AE class=EVENTS label="Adverse Events"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AESEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col AETERM  type=Char label="Reported Term for the Adverse Event"
---
AE | 001 | 1 | Headache
AE | 001 | 2 | Nausea
